  "description": "A turn of fate... by your own hand.\n\nAlicia Melfont vows to restore the former glory of her house after the Dark God's agent massacres her family. But when a mysterious book reveals that she's only a supporting character meant to die for the true protagonist of the story, Alicia decides she won't let some silly book determine her fate.\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: includes one extra chapter.*",
